#!/usr/bin/env rexx
/* File:          00-helloworl-bsf.rxj
 * Description:   Simple output of "Hello World" via the Java "java.lang.System" class.
 * Shows:         - Import of a Java class
 *                - Using static members (fetching object stored in static field "out"
 *                  and then using that object's method "println")
